English summary

This repository is for a university/college C++ programming final project demo.

Permitted: course staff and peers may view, build, and run for grading,
demonstration, and learning; short excerpts in course reports with attribution.

Not permitted without written permission: commercial use, sublicensing for sale,
redistribution after removing this notice, or implying affiliation with official
Crazy Arcade / 爆爆王 IP.

Third-party assets are under their own licenses (see `assets/CREDITS.md`).

